WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.710
When was the last time brunch
gave you an actual break?

00:00:03.113 --> 00:00:04.789
Imagine putting the phone away

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:08.113
and finding a seat where nobody
needs you to organize a thing.

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:12.783
Mommy and Daddy Break Club brings
parents together around a slower morning.

00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:17.536
An edition might pair gentle movement
with coffee, brunch or a mimosa.

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:21.259
There is time to relax,
meet someone and take a photo.

00:00:21.657 --> 00:00:24.212
Each invitation tells you
what's planned for that date.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.893
Behind the morning,
VNV coordinates catering,

00:00:28.292 --> 00:00:31.904
décor, multimedia, staffing and logistics.

00:00:32.303 --> 00:00:35.764
Your host handles the details
so you can stay for the conversation.

00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:39.624
Our producers work on more than
two hundred and fifty small

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:43.402
and midsize events each year,
in addition to corporate productions.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.613
This one has a pace all its own.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:47.783
Join the free priority list.

00:00:48.182 --> 00:00:50.613
When an edition opens,
you'll see the details

00:00:50.627 --> 00:00:52.811
and can decide whether
to book your places.
